//! rquickjs-based code-mode runtime for wasm32-wasip2.
//! Auto-generated by codex-codemod. Do not edit.
//!
//! Replaces the V8 runtime stub with a working QuickJS implementation.
//! All type definitions are preserved; spawn_runtime() now creates a
//! real JavaScript execution environment.

